title: Tour the agrupaciones
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: sp_exile
view-if: sanchez_leader = 0 and exiled = 0 and exile_tour_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; exile_tour_timer = 2

= Tour the agrupaciones

No car from the party, no staff. You drive yourself from one local branch to the next, as you did in 2014.

- @tour_members: Listen to the members
- @tour_critic: Criticise the leadership's line

@tour_members
on-arrival: sanchismo += 5; member_morale += 2

The halls are small and full. The members tell you what they would not tell Ferraz.

@tour_critic
on-arrival: {! Q.sanchismo += 7; Q.populism += 1; Q.member_morale -= 2; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.transferRaw(Q, 'psoe', {up: 0.5, cs: 0.5}, {students: 0.5, workers: 0.5}); } !}

"The PSOE has forgotten who it is for." The leadership calls it disloyalty; the members call it the truth.

@book
title: Write a book
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: sp_exile
view-if: sanchez_leader = 0 and exile_book_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; exile_book_timer = 12

= Write a book

A publisher offers you an advance for your account of the last years. The working title is *Manual de resistencia*.

- @book_yes: Write it
- @root: Not now

@book_yes
on-arrival: sanchismo += 6; funds += 1; populism += 1

It sells well. Everyone in politics reads the chapter about themselves first.

@organise
title: Build the organisation
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: sp_exile
view-if: exiled = 1 and player_is_ps = 1 and exile_org_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; exile_org_timer = 2

= Build the organisation

A new party needs branches in fifty-two provinces, candidates, lawyers and money.

- @org_branches: Open branches across Spain
- @org_defectors: Recruit PSOE mayors and councillors
- @org_movement: Run it as a movement: open primaries and online votes

@org_branches
subtitle: Costs 1 in party funds.
choose-if: funds >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Needs 1 in party funds.
on-arrival: {! Q.funds -= 1; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.campaignRaw(Q, 'ps', {workers: 0.8, pensioners: 0.6, professionals: 0.6, unemployed: 0.6, students: 0.5, homemakers: 0.4, self_employed: 0.3}); } !}

[+ new_party_name +] now exists outside Madrid.

@org_defectors
on-arrival: {! Q.rel_psoe = (Q.rel_psoe || 15) - 6; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.transferRaw(Q, 'psoe', 'ps', {pensioners: 1, workers: 1, homemakers: 0.6}); } !}

A dozen mayors in Andalusia and Extremadura switch sides. The PSOE's new leadership is furious.

@org_movement
on-arrival: {! Q.populism += 1; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.campaignRaw(Q, 'ps', {students: 1.2, unemployed: 0.8, professionals: 0.5}); } !}

Young volunteers join by the thousand. The press calls it Podemos with a tie.

@bid
title: Bid for the leadership
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: sp_exile
view-if: exiled = 1 and player_leads = 0 and player_is_ps = 0 and exile_bid_timer <= 0 and elections_held >= 2
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; exile_bid_timer = 6

= Bid for the leadership

[+ my_party +] is not doing as well as it hoped. Some of its members think the newcomer with a national profile should lead it.

- @bid_go: Stand for the leadership
- @root: Not yet

@bid_go
on-arrival: {! Q.bid_won = (Q.sanchismo + Q.populism * 3 + (Math.random() * 20 - 10) >= 45) ? 1 : 0; if (Q.bid_won) { Q.player_leads = 1; } else { Q.sanchismo -= 5; } !}

[? if bid_won = 1 : The members choose you. Pedro Sánchez leads [+ my_party +], and would be its candidate for Prime Minister. ?][? if bid_won = 0 : The founders close ranks. The newcomer will have to wait. ?]

@bridge
title: Bridges to the PSOE
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: sp_exile
view-if: exiled = 1 and exile_bridge_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; exile_bridge_timer = 3

= Bridges to the PSOE

Old colleagues still take your calls, some of them.

- @bridge_lunch: Lunch with old friends in the PSOE group
- @bridge_attack: Attack the PSOE leadership instead

@bridge_lunch
on-arrival: {! Q.rel_psoe = (Q.rel_psoe || 20) + 8; !}

The conversation is awkward and useful.

@bridge_attack
on-arrival: {! Q.rel_psoe = (Q.rel_psoe || 20) - 6; Q.populism += 1; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.transferRaw(Q, 'psoe', Q.player_party, {workers: 0.6, students: 0.4}); } !}

Some PSOE voters agree with you. None of its leaders will.

@exile_funds
title: Raise money
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: sp_exile
view-if: exiled = 1 and exile_funds_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; exile_funds_timer = 3

= Raise money

- @funds_small: Small donations from supporters
- @funds_big: A dinner with business donors

@funds_small
on-arrival: {! Q.funds += 0.6 + Q.sanchismo / 60; !}

Thousands of small transfers. Not much, but nobody owns you.

@funds_big
on-arrival: {! Q.funds += 2; Q.populism -= 1; !}

A generous evening. The photos are less generous.

@low_profile
title: Keep a low profile
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: sp_exile
view-if: sanchez_leader = 0 and low_profile_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; low_profile_timer = 3

= Keep a low profile

A quiet month: a few interviews declined, a few calls returned, a lot of reading.

- @low_watch: Watch and wait
- @low_calls: Keep in touch with your people

@low_watch
on-arrival: sanchismo -= 1

Out of sight is, a little, out of mind.

@low_calls
on-arrival: {! Q.sanchismo += 1; Q.network = (Q.network || 0) + 1; !}

Your network holds together.

@bb_interview
title: Break your silence
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: sp_exile
view-if: sanchez_leader = 0 and exiled = 0 and bb_interview_timer <= 0
on-arrival: {! Q.month_actions += 1; Q.bb_interview_timer = 4; !}

= Break your silence

[? if year <= 2016 : Jordi Évole wants, for Salvados, ?][? if year > 2016 : A prime-time interviewer wants ?] your first full account of how you were forced out. Everything you say will be replayed for months.

- @iv_story: Tell the whole story: the banks, the media and the barons who wanted you gone
- @iv_measured: Be measured: explain your reasons, blame nobody by name
- @iv_decline: Decline: a former leader should not wash the party's linen in public

@iv_story
subtitle: Your followers grow fast; the new leadership and the party's image suffer
on-arrival: {! Q.sanchismo += 9; Q.populism += 1; Q.network = (Q.network || 0) + 6; Q.rel_leadership = (Q.rel_leadership || 40) - 12; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.transferRaw(Q, 'psoe', { up: 0.7, cs: 0.3 }, { workers: 0.4, students: 0.5, professionals: 0.3 }); } !}

The interview is a sensation. Millions watch you name the powers that wanted you out: El País and its owners at Prisa, the banks, César Alierta's Telefónica, none of whom wanted a government with Podemos. Your phone fills with offers to volunteer; Ferraz accuses you of damaging the party, and the polls show a divided PSOE losing voters.

@iv_measured
subtitle: A steadier rise; little damage
on-arrival: {! Q.sanchismo += 4; Q.network = (Q.network || 0) + 2; Q.rel_leadership = (Q.rel_leadership || 40) - 2; !}

You come across as serious and wounded. Fewer headlines, fewer enemies.

@iv_decline
subtitle: Keeps the peace with the leadership; your followers wonder where you are
on-arrival: {! Q.sanchismo -= 2; Q.rel_leadership = (Q.rel_leadership || 40) + 5; !}

Silence earns you some respect in Ferraz, and some impatience among your own people.

@bb_team
title: Build your team
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: sp_exile
view-if: sanchez_leader = 0 and exiled = 0 and bb_team_timer <= 0
on-arrival: {! Q.month_actions += 1; Q.bb_team_timer = 3; !}

= Build your team

José Luis Ábalos, Adriana Lastra and Santos Cerdán are ready to organise your supporters, province by province. An organised faction is powerful, and visible.

- @team_full: A full campaign machine in every federation
- @team_quiet: A discreet network of trusted organisers
- @team_wait: Not yet: don't give Ferraz an excuse

@team_full
subtitle: Costs 2 from your war chest; a strong network, but the leadership sees a rival party inside the party
choose-if: war_chest >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: Needs 2 in your war chest.
on-arrival: {! Q.war_chest -= 2; Q.network = (Q.network || 0) + 14; Q.rel_leadership = (Q.rel_leadership || 40) - 8; Q.expulsion_risk = (Q.expulsion_risk || 0) + 1; !}

Offices, phone banks, coordinators in fifty provinces. Ferraz talks about "a party within the party".

@team_quiet
subtitle: Slower, but it doesn't provoke anyone
on-arrival: {! Q.network = (Q.network || 0) + 6; !}

A few trusted people in each federation, meeting in bars and kitchens.

@team_wait
on-arrival: {! Q.rel_leadership = (Q.rel_leadership || 40) + 2; !}

You keep your powder dry.

@bb_money
title: The war chest
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: sp_exile
view-if: sanchez_leader = 0 and exiled = 0 and bb_money_timer <= 0
on-arrival: {! Q.month_actions += 1; Q.bb_money_timer = 3; !}

= The war chest

A comeback campaign needs money the party will not give you.

- @money_small: Small donations from members and supporters
- @money_big: A dinner with wealthy donors who liked your fight with the barons
- @money_own: Fund it yourself, and take a consulting job to pay for it

@money_small
subtitle: A little money; your movement grows with it
on-arrival: {! Q.war_chest = (Q.war_chest || 0) + 1 + (Q.network || 0) / 40; Q.network = (Q.network || 0) + 2; !}

Ten, twenty, fifty euros at a time. Every donor is also a volunteer.

@money_big
subtitle: More money; it makes you look like the establishment you are running against
on-arrival: {! Q.war_chest = (Q.war_chest || 0) + 3; Q.populism -= 1; Q.sanchismo -= 3; !}

The money is real. So is the photograph of you at the dinner, which ends up in the press.

@money_own
subtitle: Some money; you disappear from the scene for a while
on-arrival: {! Q.war_chest = (Q.war_chest || 0) + 2; Q.sanchismo -= 4; Q.network = Math.max(0, (Q.network || 0) - 3); !}

The private sector pays well. Your supporters see less of you.

@bb_vote
title: A vote in Congress
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: sp_exile
view-if: sanchez_leader = 0 and exiled = 0 and seat_resigned = 0 and bb_vote_timer <= 0
on-arrival: {! Q.month_actions += 1; Q.bb_vote_timer = 4; Q.bb_vote_pp = Q.pm_party === 'pp' ? 1 : 0; !}

= A vote in Congress

[? if bb_vote_pp = 1 : The leadership has negotiated the PP government's budget ceiling in exchange for a few concessions, and orders the group to abstain. ?][? if bb_vote_pp = 0 : The leadership orders the group to back a deal you think betrays the members. ?] Some deputies are looking at you to see what you will do.

- @vote_follow: Vote with the group
- @vote_rebel: Break the whip and vote no
- @vote_absent: Be absent for the vote

@vote_follow
subtitle: Peace with the leadership; your followers are disappointed
on-arrival: {! Q.rel_leadership = (Q.rel_leadership || 40) + 8; Q.sanchismo -= 4; Q.member_morale -= 1; !}

You vote with the group. The leadership notes your discipline; your supporters note it too.

@vote_rebel
subtitle: Your followers cheer; a disciplinary file and a risk of expulsion
on-arrival: {! Q.sanchismo += 6; Q.member_morale += 2; Q.populism += 1; Q.rel_leadership = (Q.rel_leadership || 40) - 12; Q.expulsion_risk = (Q.expulsion_risk || 0) + 2; Q.bb_expelled_now = (Q.expulsion_risk >= 4 && Math.random() < 0.35) ? 1 : 0; if (Q.bb_expelled_now) { Q.expelled = 1; Q.backbench = 0; } !}

[? if bb_expelled_now = 1 : The Ethics Committee expels you from the PSOE for repeated indiscipline. ?][? if bb_expelled_now = 0 : The group fines you. The members cheer you. ?]

@vote_absent
subtitle: Avoids a fight; nobody is impressed
on-arrival: {! Q.sanchismo -= 1; !}

You are "detained elsewhere". Both sides notice.

@bb_baron
title: Court a baron
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: sp_exile
view-if: sanchez_leader = 0 and exiled = 0 and bb_baron_timer <= 0 and baron_allies < 3
on-arrival: {! Q.month_actions += 1; Q.bb_baron_timer = 4; !}

= Court a baron

Most regional leaders backed your removal, but not all of them. Francina Armengol in the Balearics, Miquel Iceta's Catalan socialists, Idoia Mendia's Basque socialists and Luis Tudanca in Castile and León stood with you in October; the question is whether they will say so in public, and at what price.

- @baron_federal: Promise them a federal party with real autonomy for the federations
- @baron_posts: Promise their people posts in your future Executive
- @baron_none: No deals with the apparatus: the members are enough

@baron_federal
subtitle: Wins an ally; a promise the federations will hold you to
on-arrival: {! Q.baron_allies = (Q.baron_allies || 0) + 1; Q.federal_promise = (Q.federal_promise || 0) + 1; Q.populism -= 0.5; !}

A baron agrees to stay neutral, and to let it be known. The federations will remember what you promised.

@baron_posts
subtitle: Wins an ally; fewer posts for your own people later
on-arrival: {! Q.baron_allies = (Q.baron_allies || 0) + 1; Q.network = Math.max(0, (Q.network || 0) - 4); Q.populism -= 1; !}

A deal. Your organisers grumble that the posts were theirs.

@baron_none
subtitle: Your purest followers love it; the apparatus stays united against you
on-arrival: {! Q.sanchismo += 4; Q.populism += 1; !}

"Me against the apparatus" is a good story. It is also a lonely one.

@bb_programme
title: The programme for the comeback
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: sp_exile
view-if: sanchez_leader = 0 and exiled = 0 and bb_programme_timer <= 0
on-arrival: {! Q.month_actions += 1; Q.bb_programme_timer = 6; !}

= The programme for the comeback

Your campaign needs ideas, not only grievances. What will the PSOE be if you return?

- @prog_left: "We are the left": a clear break with the right and no more abstentions
- @prog_plural: A plurinational Spain: dialogue with Catalonia
- @prog_centre: A party of government for the great majority

@prog_left
subtitle: The members love it; you will govern from further left
on-arrival: {! Q.member_morale += 5; Q.network = (Q.network || 0) + 5; Q.sanchismo += 3; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.position(Q, 1, 0.3); } !}

The slogan becomes a chant at every rally.

@prog_plural
subtitle: The Catalan socialists rally to you; the barons and Spanish nationalists are horrified
on-arrival: {! Q.baron_allies = (Q.baron_allies || 0) + 0.5; Q.network = (Q.network || 0) + 3; Q.regional_leaders_dissent += 6; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.position(Q, 0, 1); window.SpainGame.regionalMod(Q, 'Cataluña', 'psoe', 1.02); } !}

The PSC is with you. Susana Díaz calls it "a betrayal of Spain".

@prog_centre
subtitle: Reassures the barons; your most militant followers are lukewarm
on-arrival: {! Q.rel_leadership = (Q.rel_leadership || 40) + 4; Q.baron_allies = (Q.baron_allies || 0) + 0.5; Q.sanchismo -= 2; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.position(Q, -0.5, 0); } !}

Responsible, and a little dull.

@bb_social
title: The online army
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: sp_exile
view-if: sanchez_leader = 0 and exiled = 0 and bb_social_timer <= 0
on-arrival: {! Q.month_actions += 1; Q.bb_social_timer = 3; !}

= The online army

Thousands of supporters want to campaign for you on social media. They are enthusiastic, and not always careful.

- @social_unleash: Let them loose
- @social_disciplined: Organise them, with clear rules
- @social_ignore: Stay out of it

@social_unleash
subtitle: Big reach; a real risk of an embarrassing scandal
on-arrival: {! Q.network = (Q.network || 0) + 8; Q.populism += 1; Q.social_scandal = Math.random() < 0.3 ? 1 : 0; if (Q.social_scandal) { Q.sanchismo -= 6; Q.rel_leadership = (Q.rel_leadership || 40) - 6; } else { Q.sanchismo += 3; } !}

[? if social_scandal = 1 : One of your most followed supporters is caught insulting the party's women leaders. The press asks whether this is your campaign. ?][? if social_scandal = 0 : #ConPedro trends for a week. ?]

@social_disciplined
subtitle: Smaller reach, no risk
on-arrival: {! Q.network = (Q.network || 0) + 4; !}

Fewer messages, all on message.

@social_ignore
on-arrival: {! Q.sanchismo -= 1; !}

The army fights on without you.

@bb_debate
title: The battle of ideas
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: sp_exile
view-if: sanchez_leader = 0 and exiled = 0 and bb_debate_timer <= 0
on-arrival: {! Q.month_actions += 1; Q.bb_debate_timer = 4; !}

= The battle of ideas

[+ psoe_leader +] gives a major speech defending the party's line. The press waits for your reply.

- @debate_attack: Go after the leadership directly
- @debate_ideas: Answer with ideas, not names
- @debate_praise: Praise the effort, and stay loyal

@debate_attack
subtitle: More followers; the party looks divided and loses voters
on-arrival: {! Q.sanchismo += 6; Q.rel_leadership = (Q.rel_leadership || 40) - 10; Q.populism += 0.5; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.transferRaw(Q, 'psoe', { up: 0.6, cs: 0.2, pp: 0.2 }, { workers: 0.4, students: 0.4, pensioners: 0.3 }); } !}

The exchange dominates the week. The PSOE drops in the polls; you rise in the members' eyes.

@debate_ideas
subtitle: A modest gain; no damage
on-arrival: {! Q.sanchismo += 3; Q.network = (Q.network || 0) + 2; !}

You win the argument without starting a war.

@debate_praise
subtitle: Peace with the leadership; your movement loses steam
on-arrival: {! Q.rel_leadership = (Q.rel_leadership || 40) + 8; Q.sanchismo -= 3; Q.network = Math.max(0, (Q.network || 0) - 2); !}

Ferraz is pleasantly surprised. Some of your organisers are not.

@bb_intl
title: Friends abroad
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: sp_exile
view-if: sanchez_leader = 0 and exiled = 0 and bb_intl_timer <= 0
on-arrival: {! Q.month_actions += 1; Q.bb_intl_timer = 6; !}

= Friends abroad

You are still a known figure among Europe's social democrats. A visible friendship abroad makes you look like a future prime minister.

- @intl_costa: Visit António Costa in Lisbon: the left can govern together
- @intl_pes: Speak at the European socialists' congress
- @intl_stay: Stay home: the members vote, not Brussels

@intl_costa
subtitle: A credible left-wing alternative; the barons are wary
on-arrival: {! Q.sanchismo += 3; Q.rel_up += 4; Q.network = (Q.network || 0) + 2; Q.regional_leaders_dissent += 2; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.intl(Q, 'south', 2); } !}

The photograph in Lisbon says what you want to say.

@intl_pes
subtitle: Looks like a statesman; little effect on the members
on-arrival: {! Q.sanchismo += 1; Q.rel_leadership = (Q.rel_leadership || 40) + 2; Q.baron_allies = (Q.baron_allies || 0) + 0.25; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.intl(Q, 'eu', 2); } !}

Applause from the delegates, polite interest at home.

@intl_stay
on-arrival: {! Q.network = (Q.network || 0) + 1; !}

Another weekend in another local branch.

@bb_signatures
title: Force a primary
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: sp_exile
view-if: sanchez_leader = 0 and exiled = 0 and backbench = 1 and network >= 30 and comeback_ready = 0
on-arrival: {! Q.month_actions += 1; !}

= Force a primary

Your network is strong enough to collect the members' signatures that force an extraordinary leadership election. Strike now, or keep building?

- @sig_now: Collect the signatures and force the primary now
- @sig_wait: Wait and keep building

@sig_now
subtitle: The sooner the better, if your network is strong enough; failing sets you back two years
on-arrival: {! Q.comeback_ready = 1; Q.comeback_forced = 1; Q.comeback_next = 0; Q.backbench_since = Math.min(Q.backbench_since || Q.time, Q.time - 12); !}

The signatures pour in. The leadership has no choice but to call the vote.

@sig_wait
on-arrival: {! Q.network = (Q.network || 0) + 2; !}

Patience: every month the network grows.

@ex_rally
title: On the road for [+ my_party +]
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: sp_exile
view-if: exiled = 1 and ex_rally_timer <= 0
on-arrival: {! Q.month_actions += 1; Q.ex_rally_timer = 3; !}

= On the road for [+ my_party +]

Your name still fills a hall. Where should it be spent?

- @rally_south: The socialist heartlands of Andalusia and Extremadura
- @rally_cities: The big cities, Madrid, Barcelona, Valencia
- @rally_tv: A national television tour instead

@rally_south
subtitle: Costs 1 in party funds; wins older PSOE voters and makes the PSOE an enemy
choose-if: funds >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Needs 1 in party funds.
on-arrival: {! Q.funds -= 1; Q.rel_psoe = (Q.rel_psoe || 20) - 5; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.transferRaw(Q, 'psoe', Q.player_party, { pensioners: 1, workers: 0.8, homemakers: 0.8 }); } !}

The plazas are full of people who voted for you in 2015. The PSOE's barons notice whose.

@rally_cities
subtitle: Costs 1 in party funds; young and professional voters, mostly from the other new parties
choose-if: funds >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Needs 1 in party funds.
on-arrival: {! Q.funds -= 1; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.transferRaw(Q, Q.player_party === 'cs' ? 'up' : 'cs', Q.player_party, { students: 0.8, professionals: 0.8 }); window.SpainGame.campaignRaw(Q, Q.player_party, { students: 0.4, professionals: 0.4 }); } !}

Packed halls and good photographs. Whether the young vote is another matter.

@rally_tv
subtitle: Free, but the effect fades fast and your opponents get to answer
on-arrival: {! if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.campaignRaw(Q, Q.player_party, { pensioners: 0.5, homemakers: 0.5, workers: 0.3 }); } Q.sanchismo += 1; !}

Three channels, five interviews, one gaffe.

@ex_line
title: What [+ my_party +] stands for
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: sp_exile
view-if: exiled = 1 and ex_line_timer <= 0
on-arrival: {! Q.month_actions += 1; Q.ex_line_timer = 6; !}

= What [+ my_party +] stands for

[? if player_is_ps = 1 : A new party has to say what it is for, not only who leads it. ?][? if player_is_ps = 0 : Your new colleagues want to know whether you have joined their project or brought your own. ?]

- @line_party: Adopt the party's line in full
- @line_own: Push your own agenda: social democracy, Europe and dialogue
- @line_populist: Run against "the old parties", all of them

@line_party
subtitle: The party trusts you; your own followers drift away
on-arrival: {! Q.sanchismo -= 4; Q.party_trust = (Q.party_trust || 0) + 10; if (Q.player_is_cs) { Q.rel_cs = (Q.rel_cs || 50) + 6; } if (Q.player_is_up) { Q.rel_up = (Q.rel_up || 50) + 6; } !}

You become a loyal soldier of [+ my_party +].

@line_own
subtitle: Keeps your followers; your hosts think you are building a faction
on-arrival: {! Q.sanchismo += 3; Q.party_trust = (Q.party_trust || 0) - 8; if (Q.player_is_cs) { Q.rel_cs = (Q.rel_cs || 50) - 6; } if (Q.player_is_up) { Q.rel_up = (Q.rel_up || 50) - 6; } if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.transferRaw(Q, 'psoe', Q.player_party, { professionals: 0.4, workers: 0.4 }); } !}

Some PSOE voters follow the man they knew. Your new party's founders follow you with their eyes.

@line_populist
subtitle: Energises the angry; moderates and the establishment recoil
on-arrival: {! Q.populism += 2; Q.sanchismo += 4; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.campaignRaw(Q, Q.player_party, { unemployed: 0.8, students: 0.6, workers: 0.4 }); window.SpainGame.transferRaw(Q, Q.player_party, 'pp', { professionals: 0.5, self_employed: 0.5 }); } !}

"Neither the IBEX nor the apparatus." It plays well in the street and badly in the boardrooms.

@ex_scandal
title: The past comes calling
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: sp_exile
view-if: exiled = 1 and ex_scandal_timer <= 0 and time >= ex_scandal_after
on-arrival: {! Q.month_actions += 1; Q.ex_scandal_timer = 9; !}

= The past comes calling

A newspaper close to your old party publishes details of your doctoral thesis and of expenses from your years as Secretary-General. Ferraz says nothing, which says a lot.

- @past_fight: Sue, and go on the attack
- @past_explain: Publish everything and explain
- @past_ignore: Ignore it

@past_fight
subtitle: Costs 1 in party funds; your base rallies, the story runs for weeks
choose-if: funds >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Needs 1 in party funds.
on-arrival: {! Q.funds -= 1; Q.sanchismo += 3; Q.populism += 1; Q.rel_psoe = (Q.rel_psoe || 20) - 4; !}

"A campaign of lies." Your supporters believe you; the story stays on the front pages.

@past_explain
subtitle: Costs you a little now; it ends the story
on-arrival: {! Q.sanchismo -= 2; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.transferRaw(Q, Q.player_party, { pp: 0.3, cs: 0.3, psoe: 0.4 }, { professionals: 0.3, pensioners: 0.3 }); } !}

Everything online by the evening. A dull week, then nothing.

@past_ignore
subtitle: A gamble: it may die, or it may grow
on-arrival: {! Q.past_grew = Math.random() < 0.5 ? 1 : 0; if (Q.past_grew) { Q.sanchismo -= 6; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.transferRaw(Q, Q.player_party, { pp: 0.3, cs: 0.3, psoe: 0.4 }, { professionals: 0.8, pensioners: 0.8, homemakers: 0.6 }); } } !}

[? if past_grew = 1 : It grows. By the end of the month there are three more stories and a call for a parliamentary inquiry. ?][? if past_grew = 0 : The story dies on its own. ?]
